Actually per RNDIS spec:
- Generic RNDIS message header: MessageType(4), MessageLength(4), RequestId(4), DataOffset(4), DataLength(4) = 20 bytes
- INITIALIZE: MessageType, RequestId, MajorVersion, MinorVersion, MaxTransferSize = 20 bytes
